# Locally generated durable-state scopes must never sit in this checkout: the session's
# authoritative read compares the working tree against refs/heads/delivery-state/main, and
# a file that exists here but not on the ref turns a clean `durable-ref` read into a
# degraded `durable-ref-with-worktree-fill`.
**/.agent/evidence/
**/.agent/artifact/
**/.agent/attempts.jsonl
**/ci/evidence/
**/ci/recording/
**/ci/baseline/
**/data/
node_modules/
